  {
   "id": "25TOU00E:7a7",
   "ptr": "0x7a7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "彼こそは黒なるものであり、竜としてお\\n",
   "en": "He is the black one. As a dragon he swallows himself, as a dragon he dies, and as stone he is reborn.",
